WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.700
(whisper) …it's right behind you.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:11.700
Three of us are fish. One of us is the shark.

3
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:21.700
We hide in a school of a thousand fish…

4
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:33.700
…but the tasks only work if we talk, and the shark can see whoever's talking.

5
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:43.700
If you're the shark, you hear everything.

6
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:53.700
We're two developers and it's playable right now. Help us finish it.

7
00:00:54.300 --> 00:01:01.700
Back REEF RUN on Kickstarter. Keep your voice down.
